flowchart LR
    A[Breast cancer feature matrix] --> B[Train/test split]
    B --> C[Baseline logistic regression with scaling]
    B --> D[XGBoost classifier<br/>or GradientBoosting fallback]

    C --> E[Baseline probabilities]
    D --> F[Boosted model probabilities]

    E --> G[Default threshold 0.50]
    F --> H[Default threshold 0.50]
    H --> I[ROC-based threshold search]
    I --> J[Constraint: sensitivity >= 0.97]
    J --> K[Choose threshold with lowest false positive rate]

    G --> L[Baseline metrics]
    H --> M[Default boosted metrics]
    K --> N[High-sensitivity boosted metrics]

    L --> O[save_artifacts]
    M --> O
    N --> O

    O --> P[metrics.json<br/>all three model results]
    O --> Q[roc_curve.png<br/>LogReg vs XGBoost AUC]
    O --> R[confusion_matrix.png<br/>XGBoost at clinical threshold]
